  "_id": "tg-prophets-rejection-of",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I only, am left; and they seek my life, 1 Kgs. 19:10 (Rom. 11:3). Notwithstanding they would not hear, 2 Kgs. 17:14. they conspired against him, and stoned him, 2 Chr. 24:21. they mocked the messengers of God, 2 Chr. 36:16. Prophesy not unto us right things, Isa. 30:10. they shall fight against thee, Jer. 1:19. they had devised devices against me, Jer. 11:19 (18:18). men … that seek thy life, Jer. 11:21. thy brethren … have dealt treacherously with thee, Jer. 12:6. people took him, saying, Thou shalt surely die, Jer. 26:8. wroth with Jeremiah … and put him in prison, Jer. 37:15. they hearkened not, nor inclined their ear, Jer. 44:5. they say of me, Doth he not speak parables, Ezek. 20:49.",
